What is the purpose of the list C in the code below?
def binomial_coefficient(n, r):
C = [0 for i in range(r + 1)];
C[0] = 1;
for i in range(1, n + 1):
j = min(i, r);
while j > 0:
C[j] += C[j - 1];
j -= 1;
return C[r]

